==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~20 seconds<sup>30f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~20 seconds<sup>30f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
**1 [[Gory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Very similar to the original stage, but with the addition of Zory to the crew. Upon damaging the base, two Gories, two Zories, and a stack of Baa Baa spill out without a boss shockwave

Send out some fast attackers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]]. Protect your backline with [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] so you can take out the Zories before they burrow past you and destroy your base.

